I started hating you this much.)

4
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:43,000
SAMING PHON FAI

5
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:47,920
Son of a bitch!

6
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,480
(It's not because of anything else.)

7
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,240
(It's because of us.)

8
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:54,120
Son of a bitch!

9
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:55,600
Let's go.

10
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:59,920
(If only I'd told you how I really felt...)

11
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:05,320
SAMING PHON FAI
(If I hadn't let you go back then,)

12
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:11,920
(Then...)

13
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:16,160
(-Would we have ended up hating 
each other this much?)

14
